# CHECK-NEXT: b1 frequency: Normal count: 1.226192
# CHECK-NEXT: b2 frequency: Normal count: 12.261923
# CHECK-NEXT: b3 frequency: Normal count: 11.261923
# CHECK: b7 frequency: Unlikely count: 0.209844

